{"id":"n57287-1-9","stage":1,"title":"단어 · 单词","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57287-1-9-1","ko":"무슨 공부를 그렇게 열심히 하니?","zh":"你在那么努力地学习什么呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"공부를","meaning":"学习，读书","explanation":"공부：学习，读书；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"공부","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36672","senseId":"1","lemma":"공부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"열심히","meaning":"认真地","explanation":"열심히：认真地","readings":[{"term":"열심히","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67512","senseId":"1","lemma":"열심히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하니?","meaning":"表示做前面的动作或希望成为该状态。","explanation":"하다：表示做前面的动作或希望成为该状态。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"7","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"虚指，表示不肯定的事物。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"c9b4aed6d54a8847","term":"공부","zh":"学习，读书","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3","entryId":"36672","definition":"通过学习学问或技术而获得知识。","pronunciation":["공부"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"5be015e332c130d8","term":"열심히","zh":"认真地","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3","entryId":"67512","definition":"对于某事专心诚意地。","pronunciation":["열씸히"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示做前面的动作或希望成为该状态。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"表示做前面的动作或希望成为该状态。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/dee0ee17a96dc9490a0a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n57287-1-9-2","ko":"오늘 공부한 영어 단어를 외우고 있었어요.","zh":"我正在背诵今天学的英语单词呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"공부한","meaning":"学习，读书","explanation":"공부하다：学习，读书；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"공부하다","audio":"/audio/002a60f979d8c3de292f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23394","senseId":"1","lemma":"공부하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"영어","meaning":"英语","explanation":"영어：英语","readings":[{"term":"영어","audio":"/audio/9a37f8fdb58ccaa0bb5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28241","senseId":"1","lemma":"영어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"단어를","meaning":"单词，词汇","explanation":"단어：单词，词汇；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"단어","audio":"/audio/bc97e79178e9c6075345.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57287","senseId":"1","lemma":"단어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"외우고","meaning":"背，背诵","explanation":"외우다：背，背诵；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"외우다","audio":"/audio/b9471b1320d322b01853.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67856","senseId":"1","lemma":"외우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있었어요.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"002a60f979d8c3de","term":"공부하다","zh":"学习，读书","audio":"/audio/002a60f979d8c3de292f.mp3","entryId":"23394","definition":"通过学习学问或技术而获得知识。","pronunciation":["공부하다"]},{"id":"9a37f8fdb58ccaa0","term":"영어","zh":"英语","audio":"/audio/9a37f8fdb58ccaa0bb5f.mp3","entryId":"28241","definition":"英国和美国等国家使用的世界上使用范围最广的语言。","pronunciation":["영어"]},{"id":"bc97e79178e9c607","term":"단어","zh":"单词，词汇","audio":"/audio/bc97e79178e9c6075345.mp3","entryId":"57287","definition":"具有一定的意义和功能、可单独被使用的最小的语言单位。","pronunciation":["다너"]},{"id":"b9471b1320d322b0","term":"외우다","zh":"背，背诵","audio":"/audio/b9471b1320d322b01853.mp3","entryId":"67856","definition":"记住而不忘记话语或文章。","pronunciation":["외우다","웨우다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/8e1f517b0c6d9083ba8f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.83,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=57287","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":51,"sequenceScore":2.2544,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你在那么努力地学习什么呀？","我正在背诵今天学的英语单词呢。","智秀，什么时候到首尔？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你在那么努力地学习什么呀？","我正在背诵今天学的英语单词呢。","智秀，什么时候到首尔？"],"answer":1}]}
